an10.39:3.2 none
mn7:20.10 starts: They cannot purify an evil-doer,
sn4.19:3.3 starts: The ear is yours, Evil One, sounds are
sn4.19:3.9 starts: The mind is yours, Evil One, mental phenomena
sn4.19:3.10 starts: but, Evil One, where there is no mind,
sn4.19:4.1 starts: Mara: “That of which they say ‘It’s mine,’
sn4.19:4.2 starts: And those who speak in terms of ‘mine’—
an3.36:1.7 starts: May your majesty inflict due punishment on him!’
an3.36:3.4 starts: ‘Yes, lord, I have seen this.’
